 Windows Setup                                                                  
                                                                                
                                                                                
     Windows provides two Setup methods:                                        
                                                                                
     Express Setup (Recommended)                                                
     Express Setup relies on Setup to make decisions,                           
     so setting up Windows is quick and easy.                                   
                                                                                
        To use Express Setup, press ENTER.                                      
                                                                                
                                                                                
     Custom Setup                                                               
     Custom Setup is for experienced computer users who                         
     want to control how Windows is set up. To use this Setup method,           
     you should know how to use a mouse with Windows.                           
                                                                                
        To use Custom Setup, press C.                                           
                                                                                
     For details about both Setup methods, press F1.                            
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
